  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The annual event, World Economic Forum (WEF), will take place on 20&#x2013;24 January 2025, and will convene global leaders, CEOs of major corporations, economists, scholars, and thought leaders, representatives from NGOs and the media to address key global and regional challenges. These include responding to geopolitical shocks, stimulating growth to improve living standards, and stewarding a just and inclusive energy transition. The World Economic Forum (WEF) is an annual event held in Davos, Switzer</narrative>
  </description>
